      "title": "Emnify Application Token",
      "type": "object",
      "x-credential-instructions": "In the EMnify Portal, open Integrations \u2192 Application tokens, create a token and copy it here. NoClick exchanges it for an authentication token before each operation. The token needs permission for the selected operation. Connection verification reads your organisation.",
